	(text "SENSING (record sections 10, 12). U11 INA228 on the R2 Kelvin taps (Input sheet): route\n  INA_SENSE_P/N as a tight pair, INA beside the shunt, away from switch nodes.\n1 mOhm: 10 mV at 10 A in the +-163.84 mV range. Die temperature = board temperature. A0/A1 =\n  GND (0x40).\nINA_ALERT_N (open drain) is also the motor-switch EN: over-current / power / temperature limits\n  cut the motor with no MCU.\nR24/R25: fit only if the stamp or the C6 add-on has no I2C pull-ups (SPEC open item on the\n  shared bus).\nConnectors are the operator's: THERM_IN (NTC to GND), FAN_V / GND / FAN_TACH_IN / FAN_PWM_OUT.\n  JP2 picks 12 V or 5 V fans (section 10).\nQ701: a fan's PWM input pulls up to 5 V inside the fan and the P4 is not 5 V tolerant, so PWM\n  is open-drain through a FET; firmware inverts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
